{
 "_about": "Crouched steps audible, quieter (the owner, 2026-10-21; docs/notes/crouch_steps.md). A step plays the material pair of the foot material and the ground: the boots give crouch-walking actor_crouch (54, what others hear) and actor_local_crouch (57, the player himself), whose 80 pairs had no sound, so crouching was silent. Each crouch pair now plays a copy of what the walking pair of the same ground plays (actor 10, actor_local 42): the same samples, every volume_k x 0.4 (-8 dB, the same distance curve). The copies live under crouch/ (sounds/single/crouch/, sounds/collections/crouch/, sounds/composite/crouch/, their filenames prefixed). A ground silent for walking stays silent crouched. Live = stock 0.26g (no patch carries these files): take the live folder from the stock resources.db. A retune is the one scale factor.",
